{
  "title": "Dua-e-Faraj اَللّٰهُمَّ كُنْ لِوَلِيِّكَ",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ كُنْ لِّوَلِيِّكَ الْحُجَّةِ ابْنِ الْحَسَنِ\nALLAAHUMMA KUN LE WALIYYEKAL HUJJATIBNIL HASAN \nO Allah! Be for Your representative, the Hujjat (proof) son of al-Hasan, \nصَلَواتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلٰى آبَائِهٖ\nSALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA A’LAA AABAA-EHI \nYour blessings be on him and his forefathers,\nفِيْ هٰذِهِ السَّاعَةِ\nFEE HAAZEHIS SAA-A’TE \nin this hour \nوَ فِيْ كُلِّ سَاعَةٍ\nWA FEE KULLE SAA-A’H \nand in every hour, \nوَلِيًّا وَّ حَافِظًا وَّ قَائِدًا\nWALIYYANW WA HAAFEZANW WA QAA-EDANW\na Guardian, a Protector, a Leader, \nوَّ نَاصِرًا وَّ دَلِيْلًا وَّ عَيْنًا\nWA NAASERANW WA DALEELANW WA A’YNAA \na Helper, a Proof and an Eye \nحَتّٰى تُسْكِنَهٗ اَرْضَكَ طَوْعًا\nHATTA TUSKENAHU ARZAKA TAW-A’A \nuntil You make him live on the earth in obedience (to You) \nوَ تُمَتِّعَهٗ فِيْهَا طَوِيْلًا.\nWA TOMATTEAHU FEEHAA TAWEELAA.\nand cause him to live in it for a long time."
}
